348
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:45,410
彻底打垮你
making yours obsolete.

349
00:14:45,410 --> 00:14:46,690
没错  是莱纳德想出来的
Yeah, Leonard thought of it.

350
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:47,770
-非常聪明  -谢谢
- It's genius. - ?Oh, thanks.

351
00:14:47,770 --> 00:14:49,280
我没有用液氦而是用...
You see, instead of using liquid helium...

352
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:51,760
-妈呀  快闭嘴  -对不起
- Good God, man, shut up! - Right, sorry.

353
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:57,120
你没说算这个是为了整治谢尔顿呀
You didn't tell me we were doing this just to stick it to Sheldon.

354
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,330
那个...
Oh, well...

355
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:02,440
逗你玩呢  这不是锦上添花吗
I messing with you. This sundae just got a cherry on top!

356
00:15:04,070 --> 00:15:06,020
好吧  祝你们好运
Fine. Good luck to you.

357
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:08,410
军方已经对我的系统感兴趣了
The military is already interested in my system,

358
00:15:08,410 --> 00:15:09,780
我的运算也都完成了
and my math is worked out.

359
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:12,110
他的运算中还有一个大空白
His still has a big gap in it.

360
00:15:12,110 --> 00:15:13,380
在哪里
Where?

361
00:15:14,810 --> 00:15:16,030
就这儿
There.

362
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:21,940
我可以问一个问题吗
Can I ask you a question? ?

363
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:24,280
如果一种药的头号副作用是让人不停地哭
Does a drug still count as an antidepressant

364
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:28,090
它还能算是抗抑郁剂吗
if its number one side effect is uncontrollable weeping?

365
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:32,260
不知道  反正我每次哭完都觉得好爽
I don't know. I always feel better after a good cry.

366
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,400
我一直想问问博纳黛特的意见
I've been trying to ask Bernadette,

367
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,680
但她完全不回我的短信
but she's not answering any of my texts.

368
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:41,000
听着  我觉得她有点被你威胁到了
Yeah, uh, listen, I think she might be a little threatened by you, you know,

369
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:44,930
因为你能系自己的鞋带  大笑时不会漏尿
because you can tie your own shoes and laugh without peeing.

370
00:15:44,930 --> 00:15:46,390
她对你说什么了吗
Did she say something to you?

371
00:15:46,390 --> 00:15:47,650
没有
No.

372
00:15:47,650 --> 00:15:49,430
好吧  说了一点
I mean, well, kind of.

373
00:15:49,430 --> 00:15:51,410
不过没事的  她是荷尔蒙作祟
But it's okay. She's just hormonal.

374
00:15:51,410 --> 00:15:53,640
你也别担心  我为你说话了
And, you know, don't worry, I stood up for you.

375
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:55,660
我才不需要你为我说话呢
I don't need you to stand up for me.

376
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:57,430
你又不是我男朋友
You're not my boyfriend.

377
00:15:57,430 --> 00:15:59,180
我很关心你
Look, I care about you,

378
00:15:59,180 --> 00:16:01,720
你可以说这一切不代表什么
and you can say that this doesn't mean anything,

379
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:04,160
但事实上我俩算是在交往中
but the truth is we're in a relationship, okay?

380
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:07,050
总有一天你得想出办法面对这事
And you're gonna have to figure out some way to deal with it.

381
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,960
真不敢相信她居然把我甩了
I can't believe she dumped me.

382
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:14,020
好难回答  因为我完全能相信啊
This is tough for me, 'cause I can.

383
00:16:18,930 --> 00:16:21,210
很遗憾事情最后变成这样
Sorry things worked out like that.

384
00:16:21,830 --> 00:16:24,780
因为我痛苦分手  还是因为你失去了一个间谍
Because I'm in pain or because you don't have a spy anymore?

385
00:16:25,260 --> 00:16:26,680
你知道我很遗憾就够了
Let's just leave it at "I'm sorry."

386
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,560
你已经够伤心了
You're already sad.

387
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:33,240
根据克里普奇的计算
Based on Kripke's calculations,

388
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,460
我们应该能成功
I think this is gonna work.

389
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:36,680
也许我们应该今天去跟威廉上校说说
Maybe we should pitch it to Colonel Williams today.

390
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:39,020
干嘛把自己局限于美国军队呢
Why limit ourselves to the U.S. Military?

391
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:41,620
肯定还有很多人想要我们的项目呢
I bet there's a lot of other places we could take this.

392
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:43,500
我是说不会被当成间谍抓起来的那种
Without committing criminal espionage?

393
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:46,970
打击别人的想法不要钱是吧  莱纳德
You know, it's easy to shoot an idea down, Leonard.

394
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:51,090
我想我应该恭喜两位了
Well, I suppose congratulations are in order.

395
00:16:51,090 --> 00:16:54,110
你们想打击我  你们成功了
You set out to destroy me, and you achieved your goal.

396
00:16:54,110 --> 00:16:55,330
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

397
00:16:55,330 --> 00:16:57,140
军队取消了我的项目
The military canceled my project,

398
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:58,880
因为他们要和你们合作了
because they're going with yours.

399
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:01,850
不可能  我们根本还没联系呢
That's impossible. We haven't even pitched it yet.

400
00:17:01,850 --> 00:17:04,030
威廉上校告诉我加州理工的另一个团队
Well, Colonel Williams said another team at Caltech

401
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:06,300
开发出了更高效的中微子通讯系统
came up with a more efficient neutrino comm system.

402
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:07,700
我去
Damn it!

403
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,840
我们离开一下
Excuse us.

404
00:17:11,930 --> 00:17:13,340
克里普奇
Kripke.

405
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:14,930
怎么了  各位
What's up, fellas?

406
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:16,450
你背叛了我们吗
Did you screw us over?

407
00:17:16,450 --> 00:17:18,360
哇  我可不能告诉你
Ooh, I can't tell you that.

408
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:20,140
这是机密
It's classified.

409
00:17:26,770 --> 00:17:29,230
你们干嘛把点子告诉巴里·克里普奇
Why did you tell Barry Kripke your idea?

410
00:17:29,230 --> 00:17:30,380
这都怪你俩
This is all your fault.

411
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:32,010
不  是你的错
No, it's your fault.

412
00:17:32,010 --> 00:17:33,400
如果你一开始就和我们联手
If you would've come to us in the beginning,

413
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,690
这些烂事就不会发生了
none of this would've happened.

414
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:36,920
如果能安慰到你们的话  你们都做错了
Well, if it helps, you all behaved terribly

415
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,430
你们自食恶果完全活该
and you deserve what you got.

416
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:41,630
完全没有好吗
Well, that doesn't help at all.

417
00:17:41,630 --> 00:17:44,770
有时候你的社交技巧真是令人发指
You know, sometimes your social skills are very poor.

418
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:49,410
真不敢相信我们被克里普奇利用了
Can't believe we let Kripke use us like that.

419
00:17:49,410 --> 00:17:51,630
也许你们都更像那个
You know, maybe you're all more like the guy

420
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:54,120
电动汽车以他为名却不是他发明的家伙
who didn't invent the electric car

421
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:58,150
而不像那个其实没发明灯泡的家伙吧
and less like the guy who didn't invent the lightbulb.

422
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:05,910
她说得对  也许我们全都是特斯拉
She's right. Maybe we're all a bunch of Teslas after all.

423
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:09,930
特斯拉最后不是默默无闻地死于贫穷和癫狂吗
Didn't Tesla die penniless, forgotten and insane?

424
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:13,380
你对她社交技巧的评价太到位了
You may have a point about her social skills.

425
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:15,180
他才没有发疯
He wasn't insane.

426
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:17,350
他的确有爱上了一只鸽子
He did fall in love with a pigeon.

427
00:18:17,350 --> 00:18:19,130
如果特斯拉喜欢小小丑丑的东西
Well, if we're gonna call Tesla crazy

428
00:18:19,130 --> 00:18:21,130
就要被说成是疯子的话
for loving something small and unappealing,

429
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:24,210
不如马上把佩妮关进疯人院吧
might as well put Penny in a padded cell right now.

